  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOCAIP orphan programme</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BOCAIP orphan programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Botswana Christian AIDS Intervention Programme, BOCAIP, is a national body with community owned initiatives that are directly managed by management committees on grass-root levels. BOCAIPs orphan programme goal is to provide psychosocial and social support to orphans and children affected by AIDS. Sida is supporing the establishment of two orphan day care programmes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Botswana Christian AIDS Intervention Programme, BOCAIP, &#xE4;r en nationell enhet med samh&#xE4;lls&#xE4;gda initiativ som styrs direkt av styrkommitt&#xE9;er p&#xE5; gr&#xE4;srotsniv&#xE5;. BOCAIPs program f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ldral&#xF6;sa barn har som m&#xE5;l att ge psychosocialt och socialt st&#xF6;d till f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ldral&#xF6;sa och barn smittade av AIDS. Sida st&#xF6;djer skapandet av tv&#xE5; barndaghem f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ldral&#xF6;sa.</narrative>
  </description>
